---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { discordUrl } from "@/lib/platform-download";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support - TypeWhisper"
  description="Where to get help, report issues, and understand support expectations for TypeWhisper."
  canonicalPath="/support"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Support</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-lg text-muted-foreground">
      Use the right support path for the platform and release stage you are on. macOS 1.0 is the stable release; Windows Beta and iOS Alpha are feedback-heavy preview builds.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <section class="rounded-2xl border bg-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">macOS 1.0</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Stable release support for installation issues, permissions, dictation, file transcription, prompts, profiles, history, dictionary, snippets, and bundled integrations.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
          <a href="https://github.com/TypeWhisper/typewhisper-mac/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Report a macOS issue</a>
          <a href="/docs/mac/troubleshooting" class="text-primary hover:underline">Troubleshooting docs</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl border bg-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Windows Beta</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Expect to report bugs, edge cases, and rough UI behavior. Beta feedback is valuable, but some instability is normal at this stage.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
          <a href="https://github.com/TypeWhisper/typewhisper-win/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Report a Windows beta issue</a>
          <a href="/docs/windows" class="text-primary hover:underline">Windows beta docs</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl border bg-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">iOS Alpha</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          The iOS build is still experimental. Missing features and frequent changes are expected while the mobile product is taking shape.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
          <a href="https://github.com/TypeWhisper/typewhisper-ios/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Report an iOS issue</a>
          <a href="https://testflight.apple.com/join/kcCS3hcZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Send TestFlight feedback</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="rounded-2xl border bg-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Before you report a bug</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <li>Include the app version and your OS version.</li>
          <li>Describe exactly what you expected and what happened instead.</li>
          <li>List the active engine, model, prompt, or profile if relevant.</li>
          <li>For macOS, attach the JSON diagnostics export from the Error Log when possible.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl border bg-card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Community channels</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          For setup questions, workflow ideas, and quick checks, the community Discord is usually the fastest path.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm">
          <a href={discordUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Join Discord</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/TypeWhisper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Browse project repositories</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
